	<div class="wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center">
		
		<figure class="wpb_wrapper vc_figure">
			<div class="vc_single_image-wrapper  "><img decoding="async" width="1200" height="783" src="https://pensacolastate.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Beach01-scaled-e1794497554652.jpg" class="vc_single_image-img attachment-full" alt="Psc Students smiling" title="Beach01" data-dt-location="https://pensacolastate.edu/home/beach01/"></div>
		</figure>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: left;"><span data-teams="true">Take courses at Pensacola State College at half the cost of university tuition, with flexible options including online, live online, face-to-face, and hybrid classes designed to fit your schedule, and with the added benefit that your general education courses are fully transferable to universities.&nbsp;</span></p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 15px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: left;"><strong>The College is open on Monday &ndash; Friday, 7:30 a.m. &ndash; 4:00 p.m.</strong></p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 15px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: left;">Student Services operating hours are Monday &ndash; Thursday, 7:30 a.m. &ndash; 5:00 p.m., and Fridays, 7:30 a.m. &ndash; 4:00 p.m.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Please view the <a href="https://pensacolastate.edu/documents/academic-calendar/">Academic Calendar</a> for important dates and deadlines.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="--wpb-column-gap: 30px" class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid eventCardsRow psc-home-locations vc_custom_1790957250169 vc_column-gap-30 wpb_column-gap vc_row-o-equal-height vc_row-o-content-top vc_row-flex"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div id="ultimate-heading-46126afdbd36f2f6e" class="uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-46126afdbd36f2f6e uvc-9647  uvc-heading-default-font-sizes" data-hspacer="no_spacer" data-halign="left" style="text-align:left"><div class="uvc-heading-spacer no_spacer" style="top"></div><div class="uvc-main-heading ult-responsive" data-ultimate-target=".uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-46126afdbd36f2f6e h2" data-responsive-json-new='{"font-size":"","line-height":""}'><h2 style="--font-weight:theme;color:#003E7E;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;">Locations</h2></div></div><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 50px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element ">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>With campuses and centers throughout Escambia and Santa Rosa counties, Pensacola State College brings quality education, student support, and community resources closer to where you live and work.</p>
<p>You may visit in person or call <a href="tel:+18504842000">(850) 484-2000</a> for assistance.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
<div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 20px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  fancyLinks">
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: left;"><a href="https://pensacolastate.edu/about-psc/campus-info-maps/">Find a PSC campus or center</a></p>
<p><a href="https://pensacolastate.edu/tours/">Schedule a campus tour</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.photographyoptions.net/images/pstate/tour1.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Take a virtual tour</a></p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><div id="ultimate-heading-26816afdbd36f35a4" class="uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-26816afdbd36f35a4 uvc-3464 heading uvc-heading-default-font-sizes" data-hspacer="no_spacer" data-halign="left" style="text-align:left"><div class="uvc-heading-spacer no_spacer" style="top"></div><div class="uvc-main-heading ult-responsive" data-ultimate-target=".uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-26816afdbd36f35a4 h2" data-responsive-json-new='{"font-size":"","line-height":""}'><h2 style="--font-weight:theme;color:#003E7E;">Get Started!</h2></div></div><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 20px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div><div class="vc_empty_space" style="height: 5px"><span class="vc_empty_space_inner"></span></div>
